codex
All seven substantive checks are now complete. The local rules appear mathematically sound on the used domain, and the proof is demonstrably non-vacuous, but those facts do not repair the missing theorem: no submitted claim says what a nonempty call returns. I’m writing the final seven-stage review with the exact reconstruction, static inventory, mutation residual, and proven-versus-assumed ledger.
