for f in REVIEW.md evidence/provenance-structural-check.log evidence/differential-test.log evidence/translation-byte-identity.log evidence/kompile-runtime.log evidence/concrete-k-tests.log evidence/kompile-verification.log evidence/kprove-loop-group.log evidence/kprove-entry-group.log evidence/constructor-pinning-check-final.log evidence/kprove-dispatch-mutant2.log evidence/static-rule-inventory.tsv evidence/static-review-decisions.md evidence/spec-vacuity.k evidence/kprove-vacuity-mutation.log; do test -s "$f"; done
