+### Missing result theorem and body sensitivity
+
+For nonempty inputs, the absent theorem would need a destination such as:
+
+```text
+Call(Name("longest"),
+     list(stringVals(sCons(HEAD, TAIL))), .Exprs)
+  => longestAcc(str(HEAD), TAIL)
+```
+
+with the caller configuration restored. No such claim exists in
+`/candidate/spec.k`.
