+```text
+kprove spec-vacuity.k \
+  --definition verification-kompiled \
+  --spec-module SPEC-VACUITY \
+  --claims false-retain-longer
+```
+
+It exited 1 with `WarnStuckClaimState`. The residual terminal `<k>` cell is
